OL,3,ATrump's green card curbs test Indian
OL,4,Atech workers' American dream
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor millions of Indians, the road to
OL,7,Fthe ultimate career aspiration had a
OL,8,Ffamiliar script - an engineering degree
OL,9,Fto get a tech services job, then a
OL,10,Fposting in the US, repeated visa
OL,11,Frenewals and then the green card that
OL,12,Fgave them permanent residency in the
OL,13,Fcountry.
OL,15,FBut that may end soon.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,111,105,200,160,0,100
