OL,3,ATrump's green card curbs test Indian
OL,4,Atech workers' American dream
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this month, the US announced it
OL,7,Fwould suspend eight technology firms,
OL,8,Fincluding Microsoft, India's Infosys,
OL,9,FTata Consultancy Services, Wipro and
OL,10,FHCL Technologies, from hiring skilled
OL,11,Finternational workers on a permanent
OL,12,Fbasis through a widely used visa
OL,13,Fpathway.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,111,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11003
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F110A1792688068
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ATrump's green card curbs test Indian
OL,4,Atech workers' American dream
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew and pending applications under the
OL,7,FPermanent Labor Certification Program,
OL,8,For PERM, have been frozen. This is a
OL,9,Fbig blow to Indians who hold a majority
OL,10,Fof H-1B visas - a temporary visa for
OL,11,Fspecialists - which they used to work
OL,12,Fin the US while relying on PERM to get
OL,13,Fa green card and, ultimately,
OL,14,Fcitizenship.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,111,105,200,160,0,100
